  "notes": "The higher-register, more percussive half of the City Morgue front line. **His one clearly documented parameter is vocal register and role**, which the engine cannot express directly — what it can express is the beat that suits it: sparser and more purely 808-driven than ZillaKami’s, with the **808 punching on off-16ths rather than sustaining** so the bass and his clipped syllables interlock, and dense 16th hats with continuous 32nd rolls under him. ⚠ **`low`, and the research says exactly why**: everything but the vocal role is inherited from the group. ⚠ **The countermelody reached 967/1000 distinct answers against a floor of 980**, so its style pool was opened: bell_echo, arp, densityRatio 0.55. ⛔ `counter.rs` reads five styles and this roster only ever authored three — `bell_echo` is a real answer shape the engine can already play and the dataset had never asked for. ⚠ `sustain_pad` is deliberately not added: it is a held pad rather than an answer, and adding one to win a variety score would change what the record sounds like.",
